# scope: round-1 remedies (F1 behaviour-4 spawn map, F2 ADOPTION attribution) plus regression. Smoke not re-run:
#   the scrub was proven live in round 1 (W-049-review-1.log, Judgment 4) and no source file changed since.
# scratch: detached worktree $TMPDIR/w049r2/wt at 06c1eae, node_modules copied (cp -a);
#   readlink -f node_modules/@bisellium/shim -> /tmp/claude-1000/w049r2/wt/packages/shim (its own tree).
#
# VERDICT: PASS. F1 and F2 are remedied. M13, M14 and M15 are each killed by harness-env.test.ts ALONE,
# and so are both round-1 spot-checks. Gates are green on 06c1eae and the certificates recompute to
# d28661b3. One advisory (A1): the tick census inherits state written by the code under test, and two
# session-store mutations survive the full suite because of it. The remedy is exactly what my round-1 R2
