  The driver is my round-1 w049-mutate.mjs (extracted verbatim from W-049-review-1.log), narrowed to the
  single suite, with M15/M16 added. Source below.
    M13  KILLED  exit=1 FAIL=1  "behaviour 4 tick: exactly one resume per pre-existing session file ..." resumeCount=0 startCount=5 expectedResumes=1 expectedStarts=4
    M14  KILLED  exit=1 FAIL=1  same check: resumeCount=5 startCount=0 expectedResumes=1 expectedStarts=4
    M15  KILLED  exit=1 FAIL=4  first: "behaviour 4: first runTalk adds exactly 2 records" 3
  Round-1 spot-checks (two of the brief mutations):
    M06a (drop harnessEnv at runClaude)  KILLED  exit=1 FAIL=9  first: behaviour 1 start env name set
